flowchart TD
    U[Business user] --> UI[React workspace]
    UI --> API[FastAPI API and tenant authorization]
    API --> UP[Upload validation and SHA-256 deduplication]
    UP --> Q[SQLite job queue and document store]
    Q --> W[Background worker]
    W --> R[PDF, image, TIFF, Excel and CSV readers]
    R --> OCR[Tesseract OCR when required]
    OCR --> RULES[Deterministic invoice extraction]
    R --> RULES
    RULES --> LLM{Gemini enabled?}
    LLM -->|No| VAL[Deterministic financial validation]
    LLM -->|Yes: synthetic demo data| G[Gemini JSON enrichment]
    G --> MERGE[Fill missing fields only; mark AI candidates]
    MERGE --> VAL
    VAL --> DB[(Invoices, line items, issues, corrections, events)]
    DB --> REVIEW[Human review and correction]
    REVIEW --> APPROVAL[Approval workflow]
    APPROVAL --> EXPORT[CSV and XLSX exports]
    EXPORT --> MAP[Smart Data Mapping]
    MAP --> SHEETS{Google Sheets configured?}
    SHEETS -->|Yes| GS[Append via server-side service account]
    SHEETS -->|No| LOCAL[Download locally]
    DB --> DASH[Accounts-payable dashboard and supplier directory]
    DB --> PO[Purchase-order matching]
    ORIGINAL[Immutable original upload] --> REVIEW
    REVIEW --> PDF[Generated corrected-data PDF summary]
